<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  ChargeSound — English (default).

  English is the DEFAULT language so that every non-Korean device gets a
  fully translated UI. Korean users get values-ko/strings.xml automatically
  (Android picks the resource folder from the device locale).

  Rules for this file:
  - Do NOT translate proper nouns / brand names (ChargeSound, Nebula, Prism...).
  - Never use hard apostrophes ('). Use \' or restructure the sentence,
    otherwise aapt2 turns them into stray quote characters at runtime.
  - Keep placeholders (%1$s, %2$d) in the SAME order across all locales.
-->
